id: pm-kvhnb5
title: "GH-1326: Windows nightly bundled-package init test exceeds 30 seconds"
description: "GitHub issue #1326 records Nightly Validation run 36310799887 at main 2b14d2fdee9d65dd1699d79e617ab53a0ae91dc7. Windows Node 24 shard 1/2 failed two assertions in tests/unit/commands/workspace/init-command.spec.ts because the bundled first-party package initialization test timed out at 30000 ms. This is separate from shard 2 static inventory assertion. Source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1326"
